{"name": "Till the End", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One-time purchase \u2022 DRM-free \u2022 No microtransactions<br/><br/>FAST PACED AND PUNISHING! SURVIVE TILL THE END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo-developed by one person.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal Combat &amp; Power Suits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use 3 unique Power Suits: Bushido the deadly sword master, Centurion the ballistics expert, and Magi the ki-blast caster. Combine them with a wide variety of weapons to survive intense enemy waves, mini-bosses, and massive boss fights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Recruit &amp; Unlock Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete missions for shopkeepers to recruit survivors as playable characters. Each one brings their own personality, backstory, and unique Power Suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open Sandbox City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a large ruined city. Shops are scattered throughout. Visit them anytime to spend resources and accept new missions.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meta Progression</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up each character individually with XP Data Banks and permanent upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\"If you're out there\u2026we need you.  Let's take back our home.\"</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Earth has fallen. Recruit survivors in the ruins, activate their unique Power Suits, and fight back against endless alien hordes in this solo-developed sci-fi 